{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And behold, the word of YHWH came to him, saying: This one shall not inherit you</b> — because he had a son who would inherit after his old age, He did not promise him anything beyond the inheritance, so that he would not worry, for his own offspring would inherit him. And the meaning of \"and behold, the word of YHWH came to him\" is that while it was yet in his mouth — \"and behold, the son of my household inherits me\" — the word of HaShem suddenly came to him, saying: \"This one shall not inherit you.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:21:03.595089061Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}